Package: factorDFA
Type: Package
Title: Deterministic Factor Analysis for Economic Indicators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kirill", "Astrakhantsev", email = "astrakhantsev05@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deterministic factor analysis (DFA) of economic indicators for
    students: chain substitution, absolute differences, relative differences,
    index and integral methods. Supports multiplicative, additive, ratio and
    mixed models, several input formats, comparison of methods and waterfall
    plots. Output and documentation are in Russian.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: ru
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: graphics, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
